# ============================================================
# MIMIC-IV-ED Critical Outcome Prediction — .gitignore
# ============================================================

# ---- Personal / Supervisor documents ----
*.pdf
*.docx
*.doc
*.pptx
*.ppt
*.xlsx
*.xls

# ---- Patient Data (NEVER commit) ----
data/
*.csv
*.parquet
*.feather
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.pkl
*.pickle
# NOTE: this used to be the single wildcard `mimic*/`, which (being a directory-pattern
# match) also matched -- and made untraceable, since git will not recurse to re-include
# anything under an excluded directory -- the vendored `mimic4ed-benchmark-main/` code
# repository below, where 100% of M2's own scripts and documentation live. Narrowed to the
# actual raw PhysioNet export naming conventions so it no longer catches that repo by
# accident.
mimic-iv*/
mimic-iii*/
physionet*/

# ---- Cloned / Vendored baseline repositories (read-only, no M2 code inside) ----
CAREBench/
MDS-ED/
# Error-quantified-Conformal-Inference/ has two files patched for NumPy 2.0 compatibility
# (core/methods.py, core/quantile.py -- np.infty -> np.inf); it keeps its own nested .git and
# is not tracked as ordinary files from here. The patch is recorded verbatim, with a diff, in
# module2_provenance.md so it stays auditable despite not being outer-repo-tracked.
Error-quantified-Conformal-Inference/

# ---- mimic4ed-benchmark-main: NOT wholesale-ignored ----
# M2's own ~30 m2_*.py scripts, train_grud_conformal.py, and its M2_*.md documentation live
# INSIDE this vendored tree (see module2_provenance.md for why, and the fix being tracked
# here rather than restructured mid-project). Only the tree's heavy/PHI-risk subpaths are
# excluded below -- everything else (source code, docs, small figure PNGs) is tracked.
mimic4ed-benchmark-main/.venv/
mimic4ed-benchmark-main/data/
mimic4ed-benchmark-main/Benchmark_scripts/__pycache__/
mimic4ed-benchmark-main/Benchmark_scripts/*.onnx
mimic4ed-benchmark-main/Benchmark_scripts/*.onnx.data
mimic4ed-benchmark-main/Benchmark_scripts/*.egg-info/
# Upstream (pre-existing, not M2's contribution) embedding/reference-data artifacts --
# large, and reproducible from the vendored repo's own pipeline, not hand-authored by M2:
mimic4ed-benchmark-main/Benchmark_scripts/embedding_*/
mimic4ed-benchmark-main/Benchmark_scripts/medcodes/
mimic4ed-benchmark-main/Benchmark_scripts/hospitalization_triage_mlp/
mimic4ed-benchmark-main/Benchmark_scripts/m2_plots/*.b64
# CAUTION -- deliberately NOT re-included here: every CSV/JSON/pickle result file (they are
# per-patient-row outputs derived from MIMIC-IV-ED; the MIMIC-IV Data Use Agreement restricts
# redistribution of such derivatives, not only the raw tables). The blanket `data/` and
# `*.csv`/`*.pkl`/`*.pickle` rules above already cover this tree too. Deciding which
# aggregate-only summary files (if any) are safe to version is a deliberate follow-up
# decision for a human familiar with the DUA, not something to resolve here under time
# pressure by guessing which CSVs are patient-level and which are already aggregated.

# ---- Model checkpoints ----
outputs/
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.bin
*.safetensors

# ---- Python ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.env
.venv
env/
venv/
ENV/
pip-wheel-metadata/

# ---- Jupyter ----
.ipynb_checkpoints
*.ipynb

# ---- IDEs ----
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# ---- OS ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---- Logs ----
*.log
logs/
wandb/
mlruns/

# ---- Temporary files ----
tmp/
temp/
scratch/

# ---- Added 2026-10-04: keep manuscripts, vendored clones, snapshots and build artifacts out of the code repository ----
mTAN/
paper-m2/
paper-m2-v2/
paper_draft/
M2_Handoff_2026-09-21/
M2_Handoff_2026-09-21.zip
_snapshots/
mimic4ed-benchmark-main/paper_assets_pre_alignment_fix_2026-10-01/
mimic4ed-benchmark-main/paper_assets/M2_Supervisor_Handoff.*
mimic4ed-benchmark-main/paper_assets/*.aux
mimic4ed-benchmark-main/paper_assets/*.out
mimic4ed-benchmark-main/paper_assets/*.toc
*.bak

# Text extracts of the supervisor documents (roadmap, consolidated plan, execution guides): private, never publish
mimic4ed-benchmark-main/docx_text.txt
mimic4ed-benchmark-main/pdf_text.txt
mimic4ed-benchmark-main/m2_hybrid_grud_guide*_text.txt

# Generated paper assets are created locally by src/generate_*.py (removed from the repository on GitHub on 2026-10-04)
mimic4ed-benchmark-main/paper_assets/
